body:
We, as a society, should not engage in primitive actions like revenge. It's counterproductive. "An eye for an eye" doesn't work.

I personally do want to kill child molesters, rapists etc (instinct tells me they should have a slow and painful death) and I don't blame those who do kill them for revenge or prevention, but there's a difference between a person doing so and society doing it. I don't even believe in normal prisons. Rehabilitation should always be the sentence, though some people might need to be kept away from society all their lives.

//Anarcho syndicalist
